   "title": "Pneumonia = infection + a NEW infiltrate. WHERE was it caught, WHO is the host, HOW sick?",
   "lines": [
    "the setting picks the likely bugs, and so the EMPIRIC antibiotics",
    "1st dose AS SOON AS POSSIBLE (after blood cultures) · ≥ 5 days, until afebrile 48–72 h",
    "NOT improving? wrong DRUG (resistance) · wrong BUG (atypical) · a COMPLICATION (empyema, abscess, acute respiratory distress syndrome) · wrong DIAGNOSIS (pulmonary embolism, heart failure)"
   ]
  },
